Starting in November 2026, @hoangquocvietbro modified TraySense (originally a
Windows taskbar CPU/GPU/RAM hardware monitor by DMTWEAKS) into "TrayCoin -
Taskbar & Widget Crypto Tracker", retaining the Win32 layered taskbar overlay
and UI Automation placement foundation while adding/rewriting:

- Multi-exchange, DEX & aggregator price engine (16+ APIs: Binance Spot/Futures,
  OKX, Bybit, Gate.io, MEXC, KuCoin, Bitget, Coinbase, Kraken, HTX, DexScreener,
  GeckoTerminal, Jupiter, CoinGecko, CoinMarketCap, and Auto smart routing).
- Native WinHTTP HTTP/2 parallel polling pool, provider batching (up to 64 coins),
  and real-time WinHTTP WebSocket streaming with 45s zombie-socket watchdog and
  automatic Sleep/Resume & Wi-Fi/VPN change recovery (NotifyIpInterfaceChange).
- Always-on-Top glass Floating Widget (multi-column Vertical Card with 24-pt
  mini sparklines & portfolio footer; multi-row Horizontal Pill with Lock &
  Settings controls), global hotkeys, opacity, click-through, and edge snapping.
- Native Win32 2-Tab Watchlist & Settings Manager with offline search/filter,
  multi-select context actions, DexScreener token/contract search, price alerts,
  portfolio holdings, JSON import/export, and toggleable debug/crash logging.
- Zero-dependency JSON DOM parser/serializer and removal of hardware/PawnIO code.
